            "detailed_description": "Have you ever wanted to go back and re-live life as a toddler?  Here is your chance to be <strong><i>The Turdler</i></strong> you always knew you could be in this crude VR title that throws you the reins of mass destruction.<br><br>Destroy each room with gusto as you hurl toys and other household goodies at your parents favorite knick-knacks and trinkets, watching them explode to your delight.  If that's not satisfactory, drop some dookies on the ground and fling them around like the naughty little rascal I know you can be.",
